{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15361145","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15361145","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1536114501:0":{"text":"前前回の勝者はうちの村の勇士なの。あの人、弓なんて一度も使ったことがないのよ！","source_cn":"上一位赢得猎血节的勇士是我们村的，她从不用弓!","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DCE92795F780A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1536114502:1":{"text":"いやいや、あの勇士は狩りの効率を上げるために、特別にこの弓を使ったんだ！","source_cn":"不不不，她为了提高效率，才在狩猎时用了这把弓啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x649A789257B6AF34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536114503:1":{"text":"ふーん……それなら、こっちの斧はどうなの？","source_cn":"这样啊。那这把斧头呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D48857C20ED1B89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1536114504:1":{"text":"こ、これは前前前回の勝者が使っていた武器だ！これを持てば、なんと腕力が二倍もあがるんだぞ！","source_cn":"这是另一位勇士的！拿上它，你就能有三倍的力气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A1B5602EDC0586E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1536114505:1":{"text":"祭り期間だけの特別価格、イノシシ三頭でどうだい！？","source_cn":"趁着过节，限时特价，只要三只野猪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5E610CB651C4B7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1536114506:1":{"text":"偽物を買うわけないでしょ！","source_cn":"你这不是骗钱吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA46FFA59D7D0FF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:木尾":{"text":"ウッドテイル","source":"木尾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:商人鸮":{"text":"商人のオウル","source":"商人鸮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}